  "title": "Beyond the Buzz: Reflections from Convening Leaders on Transforming Corrections with AI",
  "summary": "This post recaps an intimate convening of corrections, philanthropy, and tech leaders who gathered on the eve of the Recidiviz Partner Summit to explore how AI can move corrections beyond buzzwords toward real-world impact. It highlights emerging themes—from unlocking “unknowable” data and shifting staff time from paperwork to peoplework, to using AI as connective tissue across systems and building a long-term coalition for change.",
